From 89e95bc85e996db2eb9df242b2016dbd9d8eb03e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ondrej1808 <o.hlav@post.cz>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:59:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Crafting Station: search bar, wheel scroll fixes, hidden-tab
 slots disabled, reliable recipe refresh

- Item list tab: search field (name, @modid), one-row wheel scroll, scroll clamped to filtered content
- Mouse wheel consumed by GUI widgets before other mods (Mouse Tweaks)
- Widgets of hidden tabs/groups are disabled (hidden slots no longer react to wheel/clicks)
- Fix: empty slot rows were never removed
- CraftingRecipeLogic: always re-resolve recipe on grid change, compare grid copies,
  sanitize JEI ghost stacks (wildcard meta), periodic safety re-check (GT #2285)
- build: RetroFuturaGradle 1.4.9, launchwrapper 1.17.4 (old artifacts no longer downloadable)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
